## Why This Is Asked

Assesses capability to design privacy-preserving, multi-tenant PCA pipelines for real-time systems, balancing drift handling, privacy impact, and latency.

## Key Concepts

- Privacy-preserving PCA (DP-PCA) and its variance impact
- Per-tenant calibration vs global projection
- Drift detection in loadings and explained variance
- Latency budgeting in streaming analytics
- Evaluation metrics: epsilon, explained variance, alert fidelity

## Code Example

```javascript
// Skeleton: placeholder for a privacy-preserving online PCA kernel
function dpPcaStep(X, epsilon, clip) {
  const Xc = clipFeatures(X, -clip, clip);
  const C = covariance(Xc);
  const noise = sampleGaussianNoise(C.size, sensitivity(C), epsilon);
  return eigenDecompose(addMatrices(C, noise));
}
```

## Follow-up Questions

- How would you validate DP-PCA performance on a production-like dataset?
- How would you adapt alert thresholds to minimize false positives while maintaining safety?

## Why This Is Asked

Tests ability to design edge-optimized streaming PCA with strict resource limits and actionable, interpretable alerts.

## Key Concepts

- Streaming PCA with randomized SVD
- Incremental imputation for missing data
- Drift detection on loadings for nonstationarity
- On-device latency/memory budgeting
- Interpretability of loadings for governance alerts

## Code Example

```javascript
// pseudo-code: streaming PCA update
function streamPCAStep(row, state) {
  const imputed = impute(row, state.imputer);
  const projected = project(imputed, state.components);
  state = updateSVD(state, projected);
  return state;
}
```

## Follow-up Questions

- How would you validate drift thresholds in production?
- How would you balance on-device explainability with privacy constraints?

## Why This Is Asked
The question probes PCA deployment under strict latency on edge devices with drift and missing data in a new domain.

## Key Concepts
- PCA, imputation, scaling, explained variance, latency-aware inference, global vs per-city models, loadings interpretation.

## Code Example
```javascript
// Pseudocode: edge PCA inference
function project(x, mean, scale, components){
  const z = x.map((v,i)=> (v-mean[i])/scale[i]);
  return dot(z, components);
}
```

